<title>USA: Brandywine in $21.5 mln office complex buy.</title>
<headline>Brandywine in $21.5 mln office complex buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON SQUARE, Pa. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BrandyWine Realty Trust said Monday it has acquired the commercial component of the Main Street Complex in Voorhees N.J. for $21.5 million.</p>
<p>The acquisition, said the company, includes  seven Class A office buildings with 234,000 rentable square feet of space, as well as 11 acres of ground under agreement to a private institution for $1.9 million.</p>
<p>BrandyWine has commercial and industrial properties containing more than 2.7 million rentable square feet.</p>
</text>
